      "text": "304K ⭐️ Skills For Real Engineers @mattpocockuk \n111K ⭐️ Agent Skills @addyosmani\nCursor 官方插件 pstack @poteto \n\n三套 Agent Skill 怎么选：模糊对齐、全流程，还是证明它真的能跑 ？\n\n@robshocks 在他最新视频「Pocock vs Pstack vs Osmani: Which Skill Pack Wins?」中对这三套 Skills https://t.co/gq4SYoOj9z",
      "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2114708510525304915"
    },
